config RTL8189FS
	tristate "Realtek 8189FS SDIO WiFi"
	depends on MMC && CFG80211 && WLAN
	help
	  This is a vendor driver for the Realtek RTL8188F (marketed as
	  RTL8189FS/RTL8189FTV) 802.11n 1T1R SDIO wireless chip.  It is a
	  full source drop from the vendor and is not the mainline driver
	  for this part; the mainline rtl8xxxu driver is USB-only and rtw88
	  does not cover this generation.

	  The firmware image is compiled into the module, so no separate
	  firmware file is needed in /lib/firmware.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here; the module will
	  be called rtl8189fs.
